LICH-007 Seed Corpus: MBC eBPF Execution

MBC programs for VM execution testing. Same 9-byte instruction format as LICH-004.
Focus on execution paths:
  - Arithmetic edge cases (overflow, underflow, div-by-zero)
  - Control flow (backward jumps, deep recursion)
  - Memory access (bounds checking)
  - Instruction count limits (infinite loop detection)
